        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.119.37"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 119:37",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Samusooni yaashuuma Timuna, yaareebayo omwishiki, muhara w'Abafilistia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.21.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kut 21:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Yainamuka, yaagambira ishe na nyina ati: Ndeebire omwishiki muhara w'Abafilistia omuri Timuna; mbwenu niinyenda ngu mumunshwererere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.24.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kut 24:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.24.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.7.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bir 7:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ishe na nyina baamugira bati: Beitu shi omuri beene waitu nari omu ihanga ryaitu tiharimu omwishiki, iwe waaza kwenda kushwera omu Abafilistia abatashazirwe? Samusooni yaagarukamu ishe ati: Nyowe munshwererere, ahkuba nanshemeza munonga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.10.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bus 10:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kwonka ishe na nyina tibaramanyire ku yaabaire eri enaama ya MUKAMA, ahakuba akaba naasherura obwiho b'eokurwana n'Abafilistia. Ou bunaku obwo Abafilistia bakaba nibategyeka Abaisraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atyo Samusooni yaashuuma Timuna na ishe na nyina, yaahika omu misiri y'emizaabibu yaayo, yaateerateeraniramu n'ekitsigazi ky'entare, kyamutontomera; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.11.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 11:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Omwoyo wa MUKAMA yaamwijaho n'amaani, yaakitaagataagura nk'orikutaagataagura omwana gw'embuzi, haza ataine ki akwaitse; kwonka tiyaagambira ishe na nyina ki yaakora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samusooni yaashuuma, yaagaaniira n'ogwo mwishiki, yaamushemeza munonga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku haahingwireho omwanya, yaagarukayo kumutwara; yaakiikama aha rubaju kureeba omutumbi gw'entare eri; ku yaahikireho, yaashanga gurimu omuzinga gw'enjoki n'obwoki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaabubomboora n'engaro, yaagyenda naaburya, yaagaruka ahari ishe na nyina; nabo yaabahaho, baarya; kwonka tiyaabagambira ku yaabwiha omu mutumbi gw'entare.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ishe yaashuuma ei ogwo mwishiki yaabaire ari; Samusooni yaateekyerayo obugyenyi, nk'oku omucwe gw'abatsigazi gwabaire guri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku baamureebire, baamureetera bagyenzi baabo makumi ashatu kumwikaza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.17.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 17:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Samusooni yaabagira ati: Ka mbahe ekishaakuzo; ku muraakiite ebiro mushanju by'obugyenyi bitakahweire, mawakimanya muti, nimbaha ebijwaro bya bafuta makumi ashatu, n'ebindi eby'ekitiinisa makumi ashatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwonka ku muraabe mutakiitsire, nimumpa ebijwaro bya bafuta makumi ashatu n'ebindi eby'ekitiinisa makumi ashatu. Baamugira bati: Kishaakuze, tukihurire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaabagira ati:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baamara ebiro bishatu batakiitsire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.16.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bar 16:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Aha kiro kya kana baagambira muka Samusooni bati: Beihabeiha baro atwitire ekyo kishaakuzo, tutakwotsya n'enju ya sho. Mutwetsire kutuhindura abooro? Tikwo kiri? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.16.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bar 16:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Muka Samusooni yaamuririra omumaisho, naagira ati: Biri onyanga, tonkunda. Ohaire ab'owaitu ekishaakuzo, haza tiwaakinyitira. Onu ati: Ku ndaabe ntakigambiire tata na maawe, nimbaasa nta kukikugambira? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaamara ebyo biro by'obugyenyi byona naamuririra omumaisho; aha kiro kya mushanju yaakimugambira, ahabw'okuba akamutonga amagara; nawe yaakigambira beene waabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha kiro kya mushanju eizooba ritakarengire, abantu b'omuri orwo rurembo baamugira bati:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.14.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
